    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekibi kya Akani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu abantu ba Isirairi bakasiisa obwesige bwabo hali MUKAMA, habwokuba bakatwara ebintu ebyasoroirwe kuhwerekerezibwa. Akani mutabani wa Karami, Karami mutabani wa Zabudi, Zabudi mutabani wa Zeera ow'oruganda rwa Yuda, akatwara ebimu ha bintu ebikaba bitangirwe, MUKAMA nukwo kubabiihirirwa muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa akakwata abantu kuruga Yeriko, yabatuma Ai, enyakuheeraine na Besi-aveni, obukiizi obwa Buturukaizooba obwa Beseri, yabagambira ati: “Mugende mutate ensi eri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obubaagarukire, baamugambira bati: “Abantu boona baleke kugenda, hagendeho nk'enkumi ibiri rundi isatu, nubo baseesire Ani; boona batagendera kimu, habwokuba abantu bamwo bake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo haarugaho abantu nk'enkumi isatu nubo baramaga. Abasaija aba Ai baabairukya, baabaturukya irembo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baabaitamu abantu makumi asatu na mukaaga, babasirimura orusozi baabahikya Sebalimu; abantu ba Isirairi baahoibwamu amaani, baatiina muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yoswa yatemura ebyokujwara bye, yajuumara hansi omumaiso g'esanduko ey'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, yaikaraho okuhikya omu rwiririzi, uwe hamu n'abakuru ba Isirairi, baayeseesa ecuucu omu mitwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa yagamba ati: “MUKAMA Ruhanga, kiki ekyakwambukisize abantu banu ekyambu Yorudaani, kwija kutuhayo omu mikono y'Abamooli kutuhwerekereza? Kyakubaire kirungi kakuba twaikaire obuseeri bwa Yorudaani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayi MUKAMA, hati ngambe ki okurora Abaisirairi nibabingwa abanyanzigwa baabu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakanaani n'enzaarwa zoona ez'ensi egi, nibaija kuhurra amakuru ago, nibaija kutugota batuhwerekereze, tuleke kugaruka kwijukwa omunsi. Oraakora ki okulinda ekitiinisa kyawe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagarukamu Yoswa ati: “Imuka, ojuumaliire ki oti okumara akasumi ako koona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisirairi bakakora ekibi baacwa Endagaano yange ei nabateereriire kuhikiriza, baatwara ebimu habintu ebikaba bisoroirwe kuhwerekerezibwa; ebintu ebi bakabiiba, baaterenganiza, baabiteeraniza n'ebintu byabo ebindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo batarukusobora kwemerra bakarwanisa abanyanzigwa baabu, abanyanzigwa baabu nibababinga, habwokuba batairweho omukyeno ogw'okuhwerekerra. Tindukwija kwongera kwikara na inywe, okuhikya obumulikaihaho ebintu ebyasoroirwe kuhwerekerezibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imuka oyeze abantu, obagambire oti: ‘Mweyeze, ekiro kya nyenkya kibasange nimwera; habwokuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Isirairi naagamba ati: “Inywe Abaisirairi mwina ebintu ebyatangirwe; timusobora kwemera abazigu banyu, rundi buli mumazire kweyihaho ebintu ebi ebyasoroirwe kuhwerekerezibwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, nyenkya mwije, buli ruganda rwemerre rwonka; oruganda MUKAMA oru araakomamu, nurwo ruraija mu maiso, ebitabu byarwo nkooku biri; ekitabu MUKAMA ekyaraakomamu, nikyo kirairra haihi nk'abantu baakyo oku bali, kandi abantu MUKAMA aba araakomamu, nubo baraija omumaiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu ogu araasangwa n'ebintu ebi ebyasoroirwe kuhwerekerezibwa, ogu w'okwokya omumurro na byona ebi ainabyo, habwokuba akacwa Endagaano ya MUKAMA, yaswaaza Isirairi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa akaimuka nyenkya kara, yaleeta Abaisirairi, buli ruganda yarwemereza rwonka, haasororwamu oruganda rwa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaleeta omumaiso ebika eby'oruganda rwa Yuda, ekitabu ekya Abazerahi, nikyo kyasoroirwemu; yairiza haihi ekika eky'Abazerahi, yaleeta omuntu omu omu, haasororwamu Zabudi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaleeta abantu ab'omunju ye omu Akani mutabani wa Karami, mutabani wa Zabudi nuwe yakomwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yoswa yamugambira ati: “Mwana wange, kugiza MUKAMA Ruhanga owa Isirairi kandi omuhaisanize. Hati ngambira eki wakozire, otansereka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akani yagarukamu Yoswa ati: “Mazima kwo nkasobya hali MUKAMA Ruhanga owa Isirairi, kinu nikyo nakozire: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obunaboine omwenagiro omurungi muno ogwarugire Sinara omumunyago, kiloguraamu ibiri ez'efeeza, na zaabbu erukuhikya ekicweeka kya kiloguraamu, ebintu ebi nkabyegomba; nukwo kubitwara, nabisereka omu heema omwitaka, efeeza niyo ebandize hansi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yoswa yatuma abakwenda baahika bwango omu heema, basanga ebintu ebi biserekerwe, efeeza niyo eri hansi yabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baabiiha omu heema, baabireetera Yoswa n'abantu ba Isirairi boona; baabita omumaiso ga MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa n'Abaisirairi boona; batwara Akani mwijukuru wa Zera, baamutwara hamu na binu: efeeza, omwegereko, ekicweka ekya zaabbu, batabani be na bahara be, ente ze, endogoyi ze, entaama ze, eheema ye na byona ebyakaba ainabyo; baabireeta omukihanga ekya Akora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa yamukaguza ati: “Habwaki, otuleetiire akabi akarukwingana hanu? Kiro kinu, na iwe MUKAMA naija kukuleetera akabi.” Abaisirairi baamuteera amabaale; abantu be na bo baabateera amabaale, baabookya, hamu n'ebintu bye byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamutaho entuumo ey'amabaale, ekiroho okuhikya na hati; MUKAMA nukwo kurugwaho ekiniga. Na hati hoona, ekiikaro eki, kyetwa ekiikaro kya Akora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
